  "code": "1790",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1024\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1022\">Elevated Plasma Somatostatin (&gt;100 pg/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1092\">\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1092\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May indicate <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1089\">somatostatinoma (rare neuroendocrine tumor)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1200\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Can also be elevated in <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1197\">other neuroendocrine tumors, diabetes, GI disorders, or renal impairment</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1336\">\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1233\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1231\">Low Levels (&lt;10 pg/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1336\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1336\">\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1336\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Typically not clinically significant but can be seen in some <strong data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1335\">hypothalamic-pituitary disorders</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1529\">\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1375\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Should be interpreted along with:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1529\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1445\">\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1445\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1443\">Clinical symptoms (e.g., diabetes, steatorrhea, gallstones)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1529\">\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1529\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Other <strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1504\">hormonal assays (insulin, glucagon, gastrin)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1528\">imaging studies</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
